answer.worked:
$$\begin{align*}
\pi r^2+\pi rl&=200\pi\\
\pi(5)^2+\pi(5)l&=200\pi\\
25+5l&=200\\
l&=35\text{ cm}
\end{align*}$$
Using Pythagoras:
$$\begin{align*}
h^2&=l^2-r^2\\
h^2&=35^2-5^2\\
h^2&=1200\\
h&=20\sqrt{3}\text{ cm}
\end{align*}$$

